CV2PRG LithoKotaro.seq
FRZ SA
FRZ CON
CCY S1 0
CCY S6 0
THC S5 0
AUT
! PTB as the OBJECTIVE (minimize Petzval blur -- it is a field flattener),
! not via the default SPO: real-ray spot evaluation of this 61-surface litho
! lens costs minutes per optimization, while the Seidel-based PTB is instant.
PTB 0
EFL = 50
IMC > 2
GO

